1
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:07,020
Why are you so late?
I've been waiting forever.

2
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:14,242
Or… you really don't know how?
Want me to teach you?

3
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:21,000
It feels way better than sitting bored in class.
Stuff like this… I'm pretty good at.

4
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:28,270
- Well… I'll go to class then.
- See you later.

5
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,290
Did you really skip class just to watch me?

6
00:00:47,245 --> 00:00:48,851
I wasn't spying on you.

7
00:00:49,275 --> 00:00:54,000
You dropped your… you
know… so I'm just returning it.

8
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,019
Damn, I didn't even realize I dropped it.

9
00:00:59,496 --> 00:01:05,485
And just now— don't tell me you didn't use
any protection?

10
00:01:06,209 --> 00:01:08,646
Don't be stupid.
You think I only have one?

11
00:01:09,667 --> 00:01:12,185
Good. Better to be safe anyway.

12
00:01:15,197 --> 00:01:16,612
Are you actually worried about me?

13
00:01:17,434 --> 00:01:22,782
Book, relax— calm down.
I'm your friend, okay?

14
00:01:22,782 --> 00:01:26,415
If I didn't care, why would I come all the way
down here to find you?

15
00:01:27,798 --> 00:01:29,258
Class monitor… you're kinda cute.

16
00:01:30,624 --> 00:01:33,251
Come on. I'm good now,
we can go to class.

17
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:38,109
Or do you not want to go?

18
00:01:39,706 --> 00:01:40,973
I can help… you know.

19
00:01:42,751 --> 00:01:46,598
Frame— don't tease me.
I'm seriously about to lose it.

20
00:01:48,543 --> 00:01:51,670
My heart's all over the place. And damn…
you smell way too good.

21
00:01:52,197 --> 00:01:53,375
Stop it.

22
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,434
You're really cute,
you know.
